    "detailed_description": "In the far future, a mysterious ship has crashlanded on the edge of a desert wasteland.  The promise of untold power awaits any driver with the muster to get there first and claim it for themselves!  Blaze a trail across the outlands in this fast paced SHMUP - build your perfect arsenal and become unstoppable! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 24 unlockable drivers - each with unique abilities and playstyles!  Everything from muscle cars to junkers to UFOs and tanks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Over 40 base weapon types, all upgradeable into two different evolved forms - adding new functions, power or both!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Choose your path along the way - a sprawling map with dozens of ways to reach the finish!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Stop in at the garage to buy new weapons, adjust your attack patterns and hire passengers to increase your weapon functionality.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Conquer huge bosses and threatening minibosses that get in your way.",
